Backport of upstream 7d722c9 "feat: resume local & bot games (#285)", merged after 2.7.1.
The next release carries it; this directory is versioned so it stops applying then.

From 7a71cf33d3dcbd818fc3bd41e92562abf17e0776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken van der Eerden <kenvandereerden@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:14:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: resume local & bot games (#285)

* save and resume bot and local games

* fixed two bugs

* fixed timing bug

* style: rustfmt resume_tests timing assertions

* test: silence sound in resume tests to fix Windows CI crash

Driving the app through menus and moves spawns rodio audio threads. On a
headless Windows runner with no audio device, opening the default sink
crashes the process with STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION (0xc0000005). Disable
sound in the test guard so no audio threads spawn.

* fix(website): pin react and react-dom to 19.2.6

A freshly published react 19.2.7 (without a matching react-dom 19.2.7)
let the carets drift apart in CI, breaking the docusaurus build with an
incompatible-React-versions error. Pin both to an exact, matching
version and add a resolutions entry so the tree can't diverge.

* forgot to include lock

* removed bad lockfile

* undo website stuff
